    "handle": "gushers-all-blue-sour-blue-raspberry-blueberry-grape",
    "body": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">If you're a fan of all things blue, this one's for you. Gushers All Blue brings together two seriously good flavors in one bag. Sweet, smooth blueberry grape and a sour blue raspberry that hits that perfect tangy note without going overboard.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Every piece gives you that classic Gushers moment: a soft, chewy shell that bursts open with a rush of liquid flavor right in the middle. It never gets old! Whether you're a longtime Gushers lover or just discovering the magic, the All Blue bag is a must-have. Grab one and see what all the fuss is about — your taste buds will be glad you did!</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Net Wt. 4.25 oz</p>",
