    "body": "<p data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"176\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"174\">Faygo Soft Drink – Black Cherry (24 x 710mL) (Can Dep)</strong></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"419\">Savor the rich, fruity taste of <strong data-start=\"210\" data-end=\"232\">Faygo Black Cherry</strong>, a fizzy soft drink bursting with bold cherry flavor. Each pack includes <strong data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"329\">24 bottles of 710mL</strong>, perfect for sharing, stocking in stores, or enjoying at parties and casual gatherings.</p>\n<p data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"440\"><strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"438\">Key Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"738\">\n<li data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"503\">\n<p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"503\">Bold black cherry-flavored soda with a crisp, fizzy finish</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"564\">\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"564\">Large 710mL bottles – perfect for satisfying big thirsts</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"627\">\n<p data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"627\">Pack of 24 – convenient for retailers, events, or bulk use</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"688\">\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"688\">Sweet, fruity, and refreshing – a favorite Faygo classic</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"738\">\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"738\">(Can Dep) – deposit applicable where required</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"758\"><strong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"756\">Perfect For:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"912\">\n<li data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"803\">\n<p data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"803\">Retailers, convenience stores, and cafés</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"860\">\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"860\">Parties, family gatherings, and casual get-togethers</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"912\">\n<p data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"912\">Anyone who enjoys rich, fruity, fizzy beverages</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
