  {
    "title": "Faygo Redpop Drink 710ML",
    "handle": "faygo-redpop-drink-710ml",
    "body": "<h2>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">A Sweet Strawberry Classic with Bold Retro Soda Vibes<br>\n</h2>\n<p data-end=\"598\" data-start=\"310\">Enjoy a true American classic with the <strong data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"349\">Faygo Redpop Drink 710ML</strong>, a legendary strawberry soda that’s been a fan favorite for generations. Made by <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Faygo</span></span>, Redpop is known for its bold, sweet strawberry flavor and iconic status in the world of retro sodas.</p>\n<p data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"600\">This vibrant red soda delivers a smooth, candy-like strawberry taste with a refreshing, fizzy finish that makes every sip satisfying. It’s a perfect choice for anyone who loves <strong data-end=\"831\" data-start=\"777\">exotic drinks, rare sodas, and nostalgic beverages</strong> that stand out from everyday options.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1179\" data-start=\"871\">Packaged in a large <strong data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"891\">710ML bottle</strong>, Faygo Redpop is great for sharing, collecting, or enjoying over multiple servings. Whether you’re pairing it with snacks, adding it to your collection of imported drinks, or just craving something sweet and refreshing, this soda delivers classic flavor with a fun twist.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1449\" data-start=\"1181\">Faygo has built a reputation for unique and bold soda flavors, and Redpop is one of its most recognizable and beloved creations. Its bright color and retro branding make it a standout addition to any shelf, fridge, or collection of <strong data-end=\"1448\" data-start=\"1413\">limited and hard-to-find drinks</strong>.</p>\n<p data-end=\"1621\" data-start=\"1451\">At Extreme Snacks, we bring you iconic beverages from across North America, and Faygo Redpop is a must-have for anyone exploring <strong data-end=\"1620\" data-start=\"1580\">rare drinks and classic soda culture</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"1640\" data-start=\"1623\" data-section-id=\"12jh0uk\">Key Features:</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"1970\" data-start=\"1641\">\n<li data-end=\"1704\" data-start=\"1641\" data-section-id=\"1qe5rzw\">710ML bottle – large size for sharing or extended enjoyment</li>\n<li data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1705\" data-section-id=\"w9hqag\">Sweet strawberry (Redpop) flavor</li>\n<li data-end=\"1780\" data-start=\"1742\" data-section-id=\"nu1jyr\">Smooth, fizzy, and refreshing soda</li>\n<li data-end=\"1825\" data-start=\"1781\" data-section-id=\"vok8j7\">Classic U.S soda brand with retro appeal</li>\n<li data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1826\" data-section-id=\"7zytqr\">Perfect for collectors of rare and exotic drinks</li>\n<li data-end=\"1935\" data-start=\"1879\" data-section-id=\"1qi6r62\">Great for pairing with snacks or enjoying on its own</li>\n<li data-end=\"1970\" data-start=\"1936\" data-section-id=\"132r7vl\">Bright, eye-catching red color</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"2055\" data-start=\"1972\">If you’re into nostalgic sodas and bold fruity flavors, this is a must-try classic.</p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm\">\n<section data-turn=\"assistant\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-42\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:dbc8baf9-952f-4441-a9d5-227e1337d163-42\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\n<div data-turn-start-message=\"true\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"9c3c9651-b4bb-41a1-8131-309cf653e0a7\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\n<h2 data-end=\"2433\" data-start=\"2426\" data-section-id=\"1xvwnkw\">FAQs</h2>\n<p data-end=\"2551\" data-start=\"2435\"><strong data-end=\"2476\" data-start=\"2435\">1. What does Faygo Redpop taste like?</strong><br data-end=\"2479\" data-start=\"2476\">It has a sweet, candy-like strawberry flavor with a smooth fizzy finish.</p>\n<p data-end=\"2624\" data-start=\"2553\"><strong data-end=\"2587\" data-start=\"2553\">2. Is Faygo Redpop carbonated?</strong><br data-end=\"2590\" data-start=\"2587\">Yes, it’s a carbonated soft drink.</p>\n<p data-end=\"2713\" data-start=\"2626\"><strong data-end=\"2653\" data-start=\"2626\">3. Where is Faygo from?</strong><br data-end=\"2656\" data-start=\"2653\">Faygo is a Detroit-based soda brand in the United States.</p>\n<p data-end=\"2780\" data-start=\"2715\"><strong data-end=\"2745\" data-start=\"2715\">4. Is this a large bottle?</strong><br data-end=\"2748\" data-start=\"2745\">Yes, it comes in a 710ML bottle.</p>\n<p data-end=\"2878\" data-start=\"2782\"><strong data-end=\"2813\" data-start=\"2782\">5. Is Faygo Redpop popular?</strong><br data-end=\"2816\" data-start=\"2813\">Yes, it’s one of Faygo’s most iconic and best-selling flavors.</p>\n<hr data-end=\"2883\" data-start=\"2880\">\n<h2 data-end=\"2905\" data-start=\"2885\" data-section-id=\"l8wp1v\">Collection Link</h2>\n<a title=\"Faygo\" href=\"https://www.extremesnacks.ca/collections/faygo-soda-drink-collection\">Faygo Soda Drink Collection | Largest Variety!</a><br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"text-center\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!---->",
