    "title": "Fanta Lychee Flavoured Bottle 500ML - China Edition",
    "handle": "fanta-lychee-flavoured-bottle-500ml-china-edition",
    "body": "<h2>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">A Crisp, Floral, and Ultra-Rare Lychee Fanta from Asia</h2>\n<p data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"742\">Experience one of the most refreshing and exotic Fanta flavours ever released — <strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"466\">Fanta Lychee Flavoured Bottle 500ML – China Edition</strong>. This crisp, fruity, floral soda is a China-exclusive flavour designed for fans who love light, aromatic drinks that go beyond traditional North American options. If you’re a collector, lychee lover, or exotic beverage hunter, this is a must-add to your Extreme Snacks stash.</p>\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"1153\">Fanta Lychee captures the naturally sweet, juicy, tropical taste of real lychee fruit — a flavour beloved across Asia for its perfume-like aroma and refreshing bite. From the very first sip, you’ll get a burst of sweet lychee nectar layered with Fanta’s iconic bubbly finish. It’s bright, cooling, and extremely easy to drink, making it perfect for warm weather, sharing with friends, or filming a taste test.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1532\">Since this flavour is exclusive to the Chinese market, it’s nearly impossible to find in Canada unless you're shopping through specialty stores like Extreme Snacks. Every bottle is imported fresh, featuring vibrant packaging and authentic Chinese labeling. Many Fanta collectors consider this one of the cleanest and most refreshing flavours in the entire international lineup.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1849\">At <strong data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1555\">Extreme Snacks</strong>, we specialize in the world’s rarest, most unusual, and hardest-to-find drinks from around the globe. Fanta Lychee fits perfectly into the exotic beverage category — refreshing, fruity, unique, and fun to try whether you're expanding your soda collection or discovering new flavours from Asia.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1877\"><strong data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1877\">Why You’ll Love It</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"2220\">\n<li data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1933\">\n<p data-start=\"1880\" data-end=\"1933\">🍈 Sweet, floral lychee flavour with a crisp finish</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1934\" data-end=\"1987\">\n<p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1987\">🇨🇳 China-exclusive Fanta — rare and collectible</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2027\">\n<p data-start=\"1990\" data-end=\"2027\">🥤 500 mL bottle imported from Asia</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2028\" data-end=\"2097\">\n<p data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2097\">📸 Perfect for taste tests, content creation &amp; exotic drink hauls</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2098\" data-end=\"2166\">\n<p data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2166\">🌺 Light, refreshing flavour profile unlike North American sodas</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2220\">\n<p data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2220\">⭐ A must-try for lychee fans and Fanta collectors</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2342\">Add this refreshing fruit soda to your collection before it disappears — Asian Fanta drops never stay in stock for long!</p>",
